{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2023-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1684195200, "end_date": 1684886399, "month_true_total": 304, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:51:41 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "138874191", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054239933", "personaname": "Barky", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lolibreaker/", "num_games_owned": 281, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 1846, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1846, "last_played": 1684425999, "avatar": "f33beb1329241c2d0ac060cbbb119b339ce3cd56"}, "language": "english", "review": "I do like this game but it gets really grindy at the end + you have to restart your run if you dont get the right buffs at the beginning. Overall its a good game, but I would appreciate more variety on the enemies. Well, after 25hours it really gets boring,", "timestamp_created": 1684885642, "timestamp_updated": 1684885642, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138865845", "author": {"steamid": "76561198839248788", "personaname": "MG.Draco", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198839248788/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 13021, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10102, "last_played": 1779606809, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "It’s ok game :)", "timestamp_created": 1684874750, "timestamp_updated": 1684874750, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138864514", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053215906", "personaname": "Coddle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198053215906/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 1179, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1179, "last_played": 1657139566, "avatar": "a9b6246b828558ee2324b039881e4f56f64b8d39"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is [u] fine[/u], but if you're used to a faster movement system at all, you may be slightly disappointed. The movement in Gunfire Reborn [u] is[/u], and [i] feels[/i] very slow, which makes the overall experience [i] feel[/i] too lengthy and a little bit boring when compared to the rest of the big names in this genre (Roboquest, Crab Champions, Risk of Rain 2, etc.).", "timestamp_created": 1684873318, "timestamp_updated": 1684873373, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138824099", "author": {"steamid": "76561198082198860", "personaname": "kenXin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198082198860/", "num_games_owned": 78, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 44887, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 32200, "last_played": 1756999705, "avatar": "e0345d95a99a0280d31aaec05676eaad7a125d2c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Do you enjoy Shooters, with various unique weapons that have their own quirks? Do you enjoy Roguelikes, with multiple ways of building your character? Do you enjoy games with a learning curve? Do you enjoy getting creative with character builds to unlock Godly amounts of power? Boy have i got the thing for you. Gunfire reborn! Dont let the 'childish' or cartoony aesthetics fool you, the difficulty ramps up stupidly well. My only problem with the game is that it saps away at my time. Sunk in many hours into this ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ thing. Worth it! Plus devs are constantly releasing new content. They always put out seasonal update roadmap, which is kinda rare these days.", "timestamp_created": 1684833841, "timestamp_updated": 1684833841, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138809657", "author": {"steamid": "76561198798894148", "personaname": "YEEST", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198798894148/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 6352, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1228, "last_played": 1770269172, "avatar": "a41301d4b9e1d39dda8f88f1c057b74f846482c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "funny furry mobile lookin ah game, but actually fun", "timestamp_created": 1684812493, "timestamp_updated": 1684812493, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}